      "source": "Kotlin <a href=\"https://kotlinlang.org/docs/reference/coroutines-overview.html\">Coroutines</a> are instances of suspendable computations allowing to write non-blocking code imperatively.\nOn language side, <code>suspend</code> functions provides an abstraction for asynchronous operations while on library side <a href=\"https://github.com/Kotlin/kotlinx.coroutines\">kotlinx.coroutines</a> provides functions like <a href=\"https://kotlin.github.io/kotlinx.coroutines/kotlinx-coroutines-core/kotlinx.coroutines/async.html\"><code>async { }</code></a> and types like <a href=\"https://kotlin.github.io/kotlinx.coroutines/kotlinx-coroutines-core/kotlinx.coroutines.flow/-flow/index.html\"><code>Flow</code></a>.",
      "translation": "Kotlin 的<a href=\"https://kotlinlang.org/docs/reference/coroutines-overview.html\">协程</a>是可挂起计算的实例，允许以命令式方式编写非阻塞代码。在语言层面，<code>suspend</code>函数为异步操作提供了抽象；而在库层面，<a href=\"https://github.com/Kotlin/kotlinx.coroutines\">kotlinx.coroutines</a>提供了诸如<a href=\"https://kotlin.github.io/kotlinx.coroutines/kotlinx-coroutines-core/kotlinx.coroutines/async.html\"><code>async { }</code></a>这样的函数以及像<a href=\"https://kotlin.github.io/kotlinx.coroutines/kotlinx-coroutines-core/kotlinx.coroutines.flow/-flow/index.html\"><code>Flow</code></a>这样的类型。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "<code>fun handler(): Mono&lt;T&gt;</code> becomes <code>suspend fun handler(): T</code> or <code>suspend fun handler(): T?</code> depending on if the <code>Mono</code> can be empty or not (with the advantage of being more statically typed)",
      "translation": "<code>fun handler(): Mono&lt;T&gt;</code> 转换为 <code>suspend fun handler(): T</code> 或 <code>suspend fun handler(): T?</code>，具体取决于 <code>Mono</code> 是否可能为空（其优势在于具有更强的静态类型支持）。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "<code>Flow</code> has only a <a href=\"https://kotlin.github.io/kotlinx.coroutines/kotlinx-coroutines-core/kotlinx.coroutines.flow/-flow/collect.html\">single suspending <code>collect</code> method</a> and operators are implemented as <a href=\"https://kotlinlang.org/docs/reference/extensions.html\">extensions</a>",
      "translation": "<code>Flow</code> 仅有一个挂起的 <a href=\"https://kotlin.github.io/kotlinx.coroutines/kotlinx-coroutines-core/kotlinx.coroutines.flow/-flow/collect.html\"><code>collect</code> 方法</a>，而操作符则作为<a href=\"https://kotlinlang.org/docs/reference/extensions.html\">扩展函数</a>实现。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "<code>fun findByFirstname(firstname: String): Flow&lt;User&gt;</code>: Retrieve a stream of data.\nThe <code>Flow</code> is created eagerly while data is fetched upon <code>Flow</code> interaction (<code>Flow.collect(…)</code>).",
      "translation": "<code>fun findByFirstname(firstname: String): Flow&lt;User&gt;</code>：检索数据流。  \n<code>Flow</code> 会在创建时立即初始化，但只有在与 <code>Flow</code> 交互（例如调用 <code>Flow.collect(…)</code>）时才会获取数据。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Coroutines support is enabled when <code>kotlinx-coroutines-core</code>, <code>kotlinx-coroutines-reactive</code> and <code>kotlinx-coroutines-reactor</code> dependencies are in the classpath:",
      "translation": "当类路径中包含 `<code>kotlinx-coroutines-core</code>`、`<code>kotlinx-coroutines-reactive</code>` 和 `<code>kotlinx-coroutines-reactor</code>` 依赖时，将启用协程支持：",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "<a href=\"https://kotlin.github.io/kotlinx.coroutines/kotlinx-coroutines-core/kotlinx.coroutines.flow/-flow/index.html\"><code>Flow</code></a> is <code>Flux</code> equivalent in Coroutines world, suitable for hot or cold stream, finite or infinite streams, with the following main differences:",
      "translation": "<a href=\"https://kotlin.github.io/kotlinx.coroutines/kotlinx-coroutines-core/kotlinx.coroutines.flow/-flow/index.html\"><code>Flow</code></a> 是协程世界中的 <code>Flux</code> 等价物，适用于热流或冷流、有限流或无限流，其主要区别如下：",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "<a href=\"https://kotlin.github.io/kotlinx.coroutines/kotlinx-coroutines-core/kotlinx.coroutines.flow/map.html\"><code>map</code> operator</a> supports asynchronous operation (no need for <code>flatMap</code>) since it takes a suspending function parameter",
      "translation": "<a href=\"https://kotlin.github.io/kotlinx.coroutines/kotlinx-coroutines-core/kotlinx.coroutines.flow/map.html\"><code>map</code> 操作符</a>支持异步操作（无需使用 <code>flatMap</code>），因为它接受一个挂起函数作为参数。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Coroutines repositories are built on reactive repositories to expose the non-blocking nature of data access through Kotlin’s Coroutines.\nMethods on a Coroutines repository can be backed either by a query method or a custom implementation.\nInvoking a custom implementation method propagates the Coroutines invocation to the actual implementation method if the custom method is <code>suspend</code>-able without requiring the implementation method to return a reactive type such as <code>Mono</code> or <code>Flux</code>.",
      "translation": "协程仓库构建在响应式仓库之上，通过 Kotlin 的协程暴露数据访问的非阻塞特性。  \n协程仓库中的方法可以由查询方法或自定义实现支持。  \n如果自定义方法可挂起（即使用 `<code>suspend</code>`），调用该自定义实现方法会将协程调用传播到实际实现方法，而无需实现方法返回响应式类型（如 `<code>Mono</code>` 或 `<code>Flux</code>`）。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "<a href=\"https://kotlin.github.io/kotlinx.coroutines/kotlinx-coroutines-core/kotlinx.coroutines/-deferred/index.html\">Deferred</a> and <a href=\"https://kotlin.github.io/kotlinx.coroutines/kotlinx-coroutines-core/kotlinx.coroutines.flow/-flow/index.html\">Flow</a> return values support in Kotlin extensions",
      "translation": "Kotlin 扩展中的<a href=\"https://kotlin.github.io/kotlinx.coroutines/kotlinx-coroutines-core/kotlinx.coroutines/-deferred/index.html\">Deferred</a>和<a href=\"https://kotlin.github.io/kotlinx.coroutines/kotlinx-coroutines-core/kotlinx.coroutines.flow/-flow/index.html\">Flow</a>返回值支持",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "<code>Flow</code> is push-based while <code>Flux</code> is push-pull hybrid",
      "translation": "<code>Flow</code> 是推送式的，而 <code>Flux</code> 是推送 - 拉取混合式。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Note that depending on the method declaration the coroutine context may or may not be available.\nTo retain access to the context, either declare your method using <code>suspend</code> or return a type that enables context propagation such as <code>Flow</code>.",
      "translation": "请注意，根据方法声明的不同，协程上下文可能可用也可能不可用。若要保留对上下文的访问权限，请使用 <code>suspend</code> 关键字声明您的方法，或返回支持上下文传播的类型（例如 <code>Flow</code>）。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "<code>fun getUser(): User</code>: Retrieve data once <strong>blocking the thread</strong> and without context propagation.\nThis should be avoided.",
      "translation": "```kotlin\nfun getUser(): User\n```：一次性阻塞线程地获取数据，且不传播上下文。应避免使用此方法。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "<a href=\"https://github.com/Kotlin/kotlinx.coroutines/tree/master/kotlinx-coroutines-core/common/src/flow/operators\">Operators are easy to implement</a> thanks to Coroutines",
      "translation": "<a href=\"https://github.com/Kotlin/kotlinx.coroutines/tree/master/kotlinx-coroutines-core/common/src/flow/operators\">得益于协程，算子的实现变得非常简单</a>",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Extensions allow adding custom operators to <code>Flow</code>",
      "translation": "扩展允许向<code>Flow</code>添加自定义操作符。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Read this blog post about <a href=\"https://spring.io/blog/2019/04/12/going-reactive-with-spring-coroutines-and-kotlin-flow\">Going Reactive with Spring, Coroutines and Kotlin Flow</a> for more details, including how to run code concurrently with Coroutines.",
      "translation": "有关更多详细信息，包括如何使用协程并发运行代码，请阅读这篇关于<a href=\"https://spring.io/blog/2019/04/12/going-reactive-with-spring-coroutines-and-kotlin-flow\">使用 Spring、协程和 Kotlin Flow 实现响应式编程</a>的博客文章。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "<code>suspend fun findOne(id: String): User</code>: Retrieve the data once and synchronously by suspending.",
      "translation": "<suspend fun findOne(id: String): User>：通过挂起一次性同步检索数据。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Spring Data modules provide support for Coroutines on the following scope:",
      "translation": "Spring Data 模块在以下范围内支持协程：",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "For return values, the translation from Reactive to Coroutines APIs is the following:",
      "translation": "对于返回值，从响应式到协程 API 的转换如下：",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Backpressure is implemented via suspending functions",
      "translation": "通过挂起函数实现反向压力。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Collect operations are suspending functions",
      "translation": "收集操作是挂起函数。",
      "count": 1
    },
